WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Qala ethangini. Yilapho kugcinwa khona amanzi okunisela.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Amanzi aphuma ethangini. Isihlungi sibamba isihlabathi.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Landela amanzi ngaphakathi kwepayipi eligudla izitshalo.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Ngaphansi kotshani, amanzi aconsa kancane embotsheni yepayipi.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Amanzi angena emhlabathini. Umswakama usabalala emhlabathini ozungeze izimpande.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Amanzi asuka ethangini, adlule epayipini, afike ezimpandeni. Indlela ihlala yomile.
